#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:5 c8a4a96a2001433eb48dcc7304de6051
msgid "AirMode"
msgstr "AirMode"

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:7 7fdabdd76fcb4948a8309246bdca84fa
msgid ""
"This is not an actual flight mode, but rather, an important feature of QACRO"
" and QSTABILIZE modes. Other flight control software refer to it as a flight"
" mode, so for consistency, its included in the QuadPlane flight modes "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"这并非一个实际的飞行模式，而是 QACRO 和 QSTABILIZE "
"模式的一项重要功能。其他飞控软件将其称为飞行模式，为保持一致性，本文将其纳入四旋翼飞机飞行模式文档中进行说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:10 09610fa0d752439da48784156b829d52
msgid "What it is"
msgstr "功能说明"

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:12 be1ff4786dcf4141a1c733cb3f156a7a
msgid ""
"Normally, in QuadPlane, if throttle is lowered to idle in QACRO or "
"QSTABILIZE modes, the stabilization is removed. While this prevents movement"
" due to vibration while on the ground at idle throttle, or when using rudder"
" arming, it prevents stabilization in flight for aerobatic movements or "
"rapid descents."
msgstr ""
"通常情况下，在四旋翼飞机的 QACRO 或 QSTABILIZE "
"模式中，当油门降至怠速时，增稳功能会被关闭。这虽然可以防止在地面怠速或使用舵杆解锁时因震动引起的运动，但也会在飞行中进行特技动作或快速下降时阻止增稳功能发挥作用。"

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:14 e19e2f1a6012490bafdf37a4063aa745
msgid ""
"Instead, stabilization even at zero throttle can be enabled/disabled for "
"these modes using an RC channel switch via ``RCx_OPTION`` = 84 (Airmode)."
msgstr "可以通过 RC 通道开关（``RCx_OPTION`` = 84，即 Airmode）为这些模式启用/禁用零油门下的增稳功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:16 e65c6feec743430d9bcb26d31925cf85
msgid ""
"if :ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>` is set to 2 (arm and disarm using "
"rudder stick), while in Airmode, you cannot disarm using rudder. This allows"
" full rudder stick throws without the chance of a disarm occurring."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>` 设置为 2（使用方向舵摇杆进行解锁和上锁），则在 Airmode "
"激活时，您将无法通过方向舵进行上锁操作。这样可以实现方向舵全行程操作而不会意外触发上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:18 ce2980e322ad41459746220d3763f418
msgid ""
"If Airmode is enabled by this switch while disarmed, and you arm via rudder,"
" the aircraft will immediately attempt to yaw to the right while still on "
"the ground."
msgstr "如果在上锁状态下通过该开关启用 Airmode，然后再通过方向舵解锁，飞机将在地面上立即尝试向右偏航。"

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:20 fcec04e517454ab4af3daf66bf017b9e
msgid ""
"If you arm using an RC switch (``RCx_OPTION`` = 154), AirMode will be active"
" but can be disabled with the above switch. If you arm using an RC switch "
"using the (``RCx_OPTION`` = 153) function, then AirMode can only be enabled "
"or disabled using the ``RCx_OPTION`` = 84 switch function."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 RC 开关（``RCx_OPTION`` = 154）解锁，AirMode 将处于激活状态，但可通过上述开关禁用。如果使用 RC "
"开关（``RCx_OPTION`` = 153）功能解锁，则 AirMode 只能通过 ``RCx_OPTION`` = 84 开关功能启用或禁用。"
